      "school_id": 1915,
      "posting_url": "https://my.corehr.com/pls/esbsheseturecruit/erq_jobspec_version_4.jobspec?p_id=042166",
      "job_title_in_post": "Vacancy: 042166 - Assistant Staff Officer - Functional Support Contract: Fixed Term - 2 years Salary: Assistant Staff Officer salary scale: €39,490 - €56,015 (Based on rates effective 1 June 2026) During this exciting time of strategic development, growth and change for SETU, we are seeking candidates with strong interpersonal, organisational, and ICT skills . The post holder s must have the ability to work in a tightly controlled and deadline driven environment. The successful candidate s will carry out tasks appropriate to a Grade IV role as assigned by the relevant manager and will work closely with colleagues across all SETU campuses . As vacancies arise in administrative roles across SETU, the functional support officers will provide administration support until a recruitment process can be completed. The expected duration in any given area will be a maximum of 12 weeks. SETU is an equal opportunities employer. #SETU",
